<title>USA: N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - May 29.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - May 29.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it had no large one day net misses in its reserve projections in the latest week, a Fed spokesman said.</p>
<p>The high in natural float was about $850 million on Wednesday, while the low in natural float was about $125 million on Friday.</p>
<p>Transporation float averaged about $15 million per day with the high on Wednesday at about $30 million primarily due to fog in Denver which caused missed connections.</p>
<p>((-- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678 --)</p>
